Subject: {Client} - {Office|Shop|Warehouse} insurance {renewal|quotation}

Dear {Client contact first name},

Thank you for speaking with us on {date}. For a business of your size, a pre-packaged SME plan is usually the most cost-effective option: standard terms, no individual underwriting, and an instant quote.

Based on {premises type} at {address}, the two most competitive options are:
- {Insurer A} {Package}: S${premium} incl. GST, public liability S${limit}
- {Insurer B} {Package}: S${premium} incl. GST, public liability S${limit}

To finalise, please send:
- Sum insured for each item: contents, fixtures and renovation S${amount}; equipment and computers S${amount}; stock S${amount}. A copy of your current policy is enough if you are renewing.
- Public liability limit required by your tenancy agreement, and the landlord's exact name if it must be named on the policy.
- Confirmation that the business has no revenue from the USA, Canada or Australia (packages exclude it; we would then use full proposal forms).

The brochures and proposal form are attached. Once you choose a plan, please sign and stamp the form and we will arrange cover from {start date}.

{Sign-off},
{TRS staff first name}

